[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2557721573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100626#issuecomment-2557721573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100626","id":2557721573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yc7vl","user":{"login":"Sch1nken","id":11414422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDE0NDIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11414422?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken","html_url":"https://github.com/Sch1nken","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sch1nken/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-20T21:11:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-20T21:11:07Z","body":"Changing the outer PanelContainer to be a normal Panel-Node fixes the behaviour. \n\nAs of now I am unsure if its still a bug and I just misunderstood how PanelContainer and Panel are supposed to work...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2557721573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599380591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100626#issuecomment-2599380591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100626","id":2599380591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a72Zv","user":{"login":"Potajito","id":39760810,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzYwODEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39760810?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito","html_url":"https://github.com/Potajito","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Potajito/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T23:44:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T23:45:54Z","body":"I do believe is a bug, because Panel Container resizes just fine if you \"wait for it\", and it's only happening on this node that I know of. Only workaround I've found is:\n`self.visible = true\nawait get_tree().process_frame\nself.visible = false`\nThat's what I had to settle with after hours of tinkering with calls defereds and everything I could think of. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599380591/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888970832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100626#issuecomment-2888970832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100626","id":2888970832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sMjJQ","user":{"login":"pawelwierzgon","id":95509019,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFaGw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95509019?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelwierzgon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelwierzgon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T12:46:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T12:46:34Z","body":"I managed to fix that by using ResetSize() on the PanelContainer after changing the RichTextLabel.Text.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888970832/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600919186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100626#issuecomment-3600919186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100626","id":3600919186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WoaqS","user":{"login":"RafaelM1994","id":29251854,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjUxODU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29251854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994","html_url":"https://github.com/RafaelM1994","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelM1994/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T08:54:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T08:54:05Z","body":"> I managed to fix that by using ResetSize() on the PanelContainer after changing the RichTextLabel.Text.\n\nThat's the answer. I had the same issue, and this one fixed it.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600919186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4054381398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100626#issuecomment-4054381398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100626","id":4054381398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xqPNW","user":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak","html_url":"https://github.com/prvak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-13T11:18:13Z","updated_at":"2026-03-13T11:18:13Z","body":"Also struggling with this issue. \n\nIn addition to `reset_size()` I had to also call `set_anchors_and_offsets_preset(Control.PRESET_CENTER_BOTTOM)` to keep the container anchored to the bottom. I also had to make the container visible (`visible=true`) but transparent (`modulate.a = 0.0`) and wait at least 0.2s before making it non-transparent.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4054381398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]